      "statement": "Collaborators hold one of two totally ordered roles — build (edit/chat/bindings, near-owner) and use (UI rendering and interaction only) — with the use surface an explicit Overseer allowlist plus two intentionally-inert telemetry subscriptions so editor hooks resolve quietly.",
